          "request": {
            "name": "Chat completions (OpenAI-compatible)",
            "description": {
              "content": "OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint. Works with the OpenAI Python SDK by setting `base_url=\"https://api.pioneer.ai/v1\"`. Set `stream=true` for SSE streaming. The response includes a `x_pioneer` extension field with `inference_id` and `routed_model`.",
